        "id": 22,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 23,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  This is your stop. Amiya and her people are nearby!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "This is your stop. Amiya and her people are nearby!"
    },
    {
        "id": 24,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Was it really okay to drop the team outside the city? You're gonna go down there by yourself?!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Was it really okay to drop the team outside the city? You're gonna go down there by yourself?!"
    },
    {
        "id": 25,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 26,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Come on, it's a lot better for them to be out there clearing a path and pushing back Reunion's pursuit forces than to fight here.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Come on, it's a lot better for them to be out there clearing a path and pushing back Reunion's pursuit forces than to fight here."
    },
    {
        "id": 27,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 28,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Okay. The terrain down there is pretty rough. This is as far as I can take you.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Okay. The terrain down there is pretty rough. This is as far as I can take you."
    },
    {
        "id": 29,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 30,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  It's fine.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "It's fine."
    },
    {
        "id": 31,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 32,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  ...At least let me put down a rope for you?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "...At least let me put down a rope for you?"
    },
    {
        "id": 33,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  When have you ever seen me use a rope?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "When have you ever seen me use a rope?"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  You're just gonna go for it again, huh?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "You're just gonna go for it again, huh?"
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Go for what? What are you talking about?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Go for what? What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Every time we have a mission together, you go off and do crazy stuff while I sit in the cockpit on pins and needles and watch.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Every time we have a mission together, you go off and do crazy stuff while I sit in the cockpit on pins and needles and watch."
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  I'm kind of used to it, but that doesn't change the fact that you're way too reckless out there.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "I'm kind of used to it, but that doesn't change the fact that you're way too reckless out there."
    },
    {
        "id": 42,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 43,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  That just goes to show you what a good rapport you, me, and my team have!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "That just goes to show you what a good rapport you, me, and my team have!"
    },
    {
        "id": 44,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Rapport my ass! Last time you demolished a town, bombed out a reservoir, and collapsed a mine!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Rapport my ass! Last time you demolished a town, bombed out a reservoir, and collapsed a mine!"
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Keep the chaos on the ground please, don't bring it onto my baby!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Keep the chaos on the ground please, don't bring it onto my baby!"
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[Character]",
        "type": "character"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"???\"]  Fine, fine. I got it. But, 'Bad Guy,' really? Maybe think a little harder next time you pick a name.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "???",
        "content": "Fine, fine. I got it. But, 'Bad Guy,' really? Maybe think a little harder next time you pick a name."
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"avg_npc_012\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_012"
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[name=\"Pilot\"]  Just jump already.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Pilot",
        "content": "Just jump already."
    },
